/*
  DetailCards.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0153 · DetailCards (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `DetailCards` resolves (table "DetailCards") lives here with its web value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns
  its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys + values extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/DetailCards.tsx), verified against
  web/src/i18n/en.json (the `drivetrain.*` namespace). The second group backs the
  native-only chrome (the unit suffixes the web passes inline, the freshness
  banners, loading / error copy, and accessibility).
*/

